silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_flat_sections_02_mittens_anchor_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'FunctorialTransportMittensAnchorYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, F sends each household household-side object to a clinic schema object; the functor pair-of-assignments names this leg." .
